            "text": "Yes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7101307",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "710130701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "710130701": {
            "id": "710130701",
            "speakerId": 20113,
            "speakerName": "Ruins Treasure",
            "text": "We who would protect our way of life, are we but making blind judgments on good and evil based on what our small minds can conceive?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7101308",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "710130801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "710130801": {
            "id": "710130801",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Yes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7101309",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "710130901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "710130901": {
            "id": "710130901",
            "speakerId": 20113,
            "speakerName": "Ruins Treasure",
            "text": "Monsters wreak havoc all across this world, and we who seek to protect it would do well to remember: Monsters deserve nothing more than the merciless slaughter they will get!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710130902"
            ]
          },
          "710130902": {
            "id": "710130902",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Touch the monument"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7101311",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "710131001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "710131001": {
            "id": "710131001",
            "speakerId": 20113,
            "speakerName": "Ruins Treasure",
            "text": "These preceding questions three, I approached my fellow disciple and asked them of he. But he chastised me, accusing me of abandoning my duty, and marched off furiously. May the true answers to these three questions bring peace to the world. In my time, I have sought the wisdom of ancient texts from all corners of the world, I have hidden myself here in quiet meditation, and I have studied the language of monsters; all this I have done in the hope of understanding their true nature. I erect this monument to be my witness when the one comes who can resolve these questions once and for all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710131002"
            ]
          },
          "710131002": {
            "id": "710131002",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Touch the monument"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7101312",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "710130401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "710130401": {
            "id": "710130401",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Yes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7101303",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "710130301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "710130301": {
            "id": "710130301",
            "speakerId": 20113,
            "speakerName": "Ruins Treasure",
            "text": "Are monsters truly evil by nature?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7101305",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "710130501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "710130501": {
            "id": "710130501",
            "speakerId": 20113,
            "speakerName": "Ruins Treasure",
            "text": "Are mortals and adepti truly good by nature?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7101314",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "710131401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "710131401": {
            "id": "710131401",
            "speakerId": 20113,
            "speakerName": "Ruins Treasure",
            "text": "Future reader, I know not whether you bear the answers to my questions.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710131402"
            ]
          },
          "710131402": {
            "id": "710131402",
            "speakerId": 20113,
            "speakerName": "Ruins Treasure",
            "text": "Anyone who reads these words must surely be of the same nature as I.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710131403"
            ]
          },
          "710131403": {
            "id": "710131403",
            "speakerId": 20113,
            "speakerName": "Ruins Treasure",
            "text": "<color=#00E1FFFF>If it is of interest to you, I have buried what few treasures I own by the pool. Retrieve them with my blessing.</color>",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710131404"
            ]
          },
          "710131404": {
            "id": "710131404",
            "speakerId": 20113,
            "speakerName": "Ruins Treasure",
            "text": "But please never forget these questions three. I pray that there will come a day when you are equipped to answer them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7101315",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "710131501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "710131501": {
            "id": "710131501",
            "speakerId": 20113,
            "speakerName": "Ruins Treasure",
            "text": "<color=#00E1FFFF>Visions</color>... They truly hail from a realm beyond. People say that they are a gift from the divine, but none can say who will receive one and why.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710131502"
            ]
          },
          "710131502": {
            "id": "710131502",
            "speakerId": 20113,
            "speakerName": "Ruins Treasure",
            "text": "Ancient texts hold that the divine looks down with compassion on the mortal realm, and bestows <color=#00E1FFFF>Visions</color> upon the worthy to help them fight against evil and protect the world. But I... I no longer burn with a desire to banish monsters. I just want to communicate with them. To understand them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710131503"
            ]
          },
          "710131503": {
            "id": "710131503",
            "speakerId": 20113,
            "speakerName": "Ruins Treasure",
            "text": "This <color=#00E1FFFF>Vision</color>... It is of no use to me."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7101316",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "710131601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "710131601": {
            "id": "710131601",
            "speakerId": 20113,
            "speakerName": "Ruins Treasure",
            "text": "To the one who views this monument: Seek ye first the monuments in the mountain, and only then return to the one erected here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710131602"
            ]
          },
          "710131602": {
            "id": "710131602",
            "speakerId": 20113,
            "speakerName": "Ruins Treasure",
            "text": "Any who earnestly seeks to resolve my perplexion should seek first the monuments in the mountain, and view them in order."
          }
        }
      }
    },
